       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks like an error.\n\n- **Requested:** ibuprofen 1600 mg PO four times daily, which is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Maximum for adults:** The usual single dose is 400\u2013800 mg. The maximum daily dose is 3,200 mg under prescription and inpatient dosing. This order is double that limit.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function and no allergies don't make it safe.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions or pain.\n- **400\u2013600 mg PO every 6 hours** for typical analgesia.\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into doses such as 400 mg four times daily.\n\nTell me the correct dose and frequency and I'll enter it right away. If you really do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that. I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first."
